            "Animate windows and lists as they open": "",
            "Asks the public GitHub API for the latest release and sends nothing but the app version. The icon in the footer checks on demand.": "Meminta rilis terbaru ke API GitHub publik dan tidak mengirim apa pun selain versi aplikasi. Ikon di footer memeriksa sesuai permintaan.",
