            "Save changes": "Simpan perubahan",
            "Show the assistant, a chat in the corner of the window": "",
            "Shows, in the right-click menu, the actions that change a cluster: delete or evict a Pod, scale or restart a Deployment. Each one asks for confirmation. It also shows the kubectl command to open a shell in a Pod. Off keeps the app read-only.": "Menampilkan, di menu klik kanan, tindakan yang mengubah klaster: menghapus atau mengeluarkan (evict) Pod, menskalakan atau memulai ulang Deployment. Setiap tindakan meminta konfirmasi. Juga menampilkan perintah kubectl untuk membuka shell di Pod. Saat nonaktif, aplikasi hanya-baca.",
            "The chat asks a program of this computer, such as Claude Code. What you ask and what it reads from the cluster go to that program and to its service. The conversations are kept on this computer, without the documents and logs that were read.": "",
